# Inkling-2-Mini on ONE gfx1030 card (V620), TP=1, DSpark with the two opt-in speed options of
# docs/rdna2/inkling2-speculation-profile.md section 9, on top of inkling2-mini-tp1-dspark:
#
# * adaptive K: the scheduler picks, every step, how many of the 7 drafted tokens the engine
#   verifies (0 to 7) from the acceptance it has seen, instead of always 2: copy-heavy text
#   (editing a file, quoting a document) takes more, text the draft cannot guess takes fewer or
#   none. The target verifies every drafted token whatever the count, so the output does not change.
# * a draft vocabulary: the draft ranks only the 32,768 most frequent token ids of an offline file
#   instead of all 200,058, which makes it 2.1 - 2.4 ms cheaper per step; a token outside the list
#   is never drafted (a cost in acceptance only: the target still samples from its whole vocabulary).
#
# Make the ids file once; it takes about half a minute of CPU and no GPU. Any code and prose that
# is not what you will serve will do, here the venv's python packages and this repository's docs:
#
#   python tools/rdna/inkling2/draft_vocab.py --ckpt /path/to/inkling2-mini --size 32768 \
#     --out ~/.cache/rdna/inkling2-mini-draft-vocab-32768.npy \
#     --code '/path/to/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/**/*.py' --prose 'docs/**/*.md'
#
# then serve (DRAFT_VOCAB=/other/ids.npy, as an argument or in the environment, names another file):
#
#   bash tools/rdna/serve_rdna.sh RECIPE=inkling2-mini-tp1-dspark-adaptive MODEL=/path/to/inkling2-mini \
#     VENV=/path/to/venv HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES=3
#
# Both options are for TP=1 and greedy decoding (the engine refuses the vocabulary elsewhere), and
# the step cost table of the policy is this card's. Capturing every width takes graph memory (1.38
# GiB, against 0.87 for K = 2) and the gathered head rows 0.16 GiB, so the KV cache holds 106,267
# tokens at SEQS 2 (125,597 in inkling2-mini-tp1-dspark): MAXLEN 105000 fits with 1 % to spare.

# shellcheck source=tools/rdna/recipes/inkling2-mini-tp1-dspark.env
source "$RDSE_RECIPES/inkling2-mini-tp1-dspark.env"

MAXLEN=95000
DRAFT_VOCAB=${DRAFT_VOCAB:-$HOME/.cache/rdna/inkling2-mini-draft-vocab-32768.npy}
SPEC_CONFIG='{"method":"dspark","num_speculative_tokens":7,"num_speculative_tokens_per_batch_size":[[1,2,7],[3,16,0]],"speculator_options":{"adaptive_k":{},"draft_vocab":"'"$DRAFT_VOCAB"'"}}'
